cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UQMaT in your research, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "UQMaT: Unified Quantum Materials Toolbox"
abstract: >
  UQMaT is a MATLAB package for constructing, solving, and analysing
  tight-binding and Bogoliubov-de Gennes (BdG) Hamiltonians on 1D, 2D,
  and 3D lattices. It supports a wide range of phenomena including
  superconductivity with arbitrary symmetry, altermagnetism, charge
  density waves, disorder, heterostructures, and quasiclassical
  transport (Eilenberger, Usadel, Keldysh).
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/uqmat/uqmat"

authors:
  - name: "UQMaT Contributors"

